  "version": 1,
  "description": "Single severity table for static SOC findings. Each finding level maps to a verdict effect: decisive findings make the technical axis malicious (HIGH RISK in the interface), supporting findings make it uncertain (REVIEW), informational findings never change the verdict. The same table is used by the Python policy and checked against the interface by the verdict contract test.",
  "level_effects": {"HIGH": "decisive", "MEDIUM": "supporting", "LOW": "informational", "INFO": "informational"},
